Hi Alain,
The version of stringi on packages.renjin.org <http://packages.renjin.org> is built from this fork of the package:
https://github.com/bedatadriven/stringi/tree/renjin

And the source you're attaching is here:
https://github.com/bedatadriven/stringi/blob/67bfd119bf183a4d4f7ecd044da4444626171970/renjin/org/renjin/cran/stringi/stringi.java

The ICU library on which stringi is based implements yet another dialect of regular expressions but it should be simple to implement something that handles a subset of regular expressions if this is holding you up.

Best,
Alex

